  m_text: "Privacy Policy for [Game Name]: By installing and playing this application,
    you acknowledge and agree to the collection and use of information as outlined
    in this policy. We, [Developer Name], along with our trusted third-party service
    providers (such as Unity Analytics and advertising networks), automatically collect
    and process certain technical data\u2014including your unique device identifier,
    IP address, system logs, and gameplay statistics (e.g., high scores, unlocked
    items)\u2014solely for the purposes of improving game stability, optimizing user
    experience, and delivering relevant advertisements. We generally do not collect
    personally identifiable information (such as your name or address) unless voluntarily
    provided for support purposes, and you retain the right to request data deletion
